angka, simbol, dan karakter lainnya yang memiliki gaya tertentu dan dirancang untuk digunakan dalam cetakan atau tampilan elektronik**\n\n.\n## 7. Jenis logo berdasarkan bentuknya\n### Letter Mark\n\n![","target":"https://cdnwpedutorenews.gramedia.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/13191001/Logo2.png","line":253,"embedded":true},{"title":"Pasted image 20250521033441.png","target":"Pasted image 20250521033441.png","line":312,"embedded":true},{"title":"Pasted image 20250521033713.png","target":"Pasted image 20250521033713.png","line":367,"embedded":true},{"title":"Pasted image 20250521033722.png","target":"Pasted image 20250521033722.png","line":368,"embedded":true},{"title":"*Assemblage*","target":"https://id.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Assemblage&action=edit&redlink=1","line":530},{"title":"benda-benda temuan","target":"https://id.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Benda_temuan&action=edit&redlink=1","line":530},{"title":"media","target":"https://id.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Media_seni&action=edit&redlink=1","line":530},{"title":"cat","target":"https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cat","line":530},{"title":"kain","target":"https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kain","line":530},{"title":"kayu","target":"https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kayu","line":530},{"title":"kertas","target":"https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kertas","line":530},{"title":"kolase","target":"https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kolase","line":530},{"title":"media","target":"https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Media","line":530},{"title":"patung","target":"https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Patung","line":530},{"title":"seni visual","target":"https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seni_visual","line":530},{"title":"seni multimedia","target":"https://id.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Seni_multimedia&action=edit&redlink=1","line":532},{"title":"keindahan karya seni","target":"https://www.kompas.com/tag/keindahan-karya-seni","line":546},{"title":"Contoh alat musik harmonis","target":"https://www.kompas.com/tag/contoh-alat-musik-harmonis","line"